Embeds as a library
A pure JavaScript package for Node ≥ 24 or Bun ≥ 1.4, with no WASM module, native addon, or isolate to wire up. Call Runtime.make, pass plain host functions, and run.
A small, fast virtual machine for a subset of JavaScript.
What it is and what it is not
A small bytecode virtual machine for running little scripts and agent code mode inside your Node or Bun app.
